title: Streetfighting
new-page: true
is-card: true
on-arrival: streetfighting_timer = 6; month_actions += 1; pps_militia_training_cost = 2 if pps_militia_militancy > 0.1 else pps_militia_training_cost = 1; pps_militia_training_cost = 3 if pps_militia_militancy > 0.25; strife += 1
view-if: year >= 1930 and sa_strength >= 150 and streetfighting_timer == 0 and not return_to_normalcy
card-image: img/blutmai_2.jpg
tags: party_affairs; antifascism

= Streetfighting

Battles rage between nationalist militias, communist militias, the state police and our own [+ pps_militia_name +]. The inherited numerical opponent model remains temporary while the Polish party and security systems are researched.

We must do something to protect the workers against these predations.

# - @battle: Test our defense units in battle against the fascists!
- @arm_rb: Increase training and equipment for [+ pps_militia_name +].
- @if_training: Improve operational cooperation with the trade unions.
- @prussian_police_training: Accept training from cooperative elements of the state police.
- @peace: Try to avoid all militant confrontations, as much as possible.
- @truce_rfb: Try to make peace with the RFB.
- @easy_discard

@battle
view-if: pps_militia_militancy > 0.1 and pps_militia_militancy < 0.5
on-arrival: pps_militia_militancy += 0.1; sa_strength += 40; pps_militia_strength -= 100;
max-visits: 1

Many militia members are not ready for actual fighting and quit. The remainder are toughened, while nationalist militias use the confrontations to recruit.

@arm_rb
subtitle: -[+ pps_militia_training_cost +] resource
choose-if: resources >= pps_militia_training_cost
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources ([+ pps_militia_training_cost +] needed).
on-arrival: resources -= pps_militia_training_cost; pps_militia_militancy += 0.06; pps_militia_strength += 50; sa_strength += 50

We have increased training and acquired more equipment for the party militia. Nationalist militias intensify their own recruitment in response.


@if_training
view-if: pps_militia_union_cooperation == 1
on-arrival: pps_militia_militancy += 0.03; sa_strength += 50;
max-visits: 2

The militia and trade unions improve their coordination in protecting rallies and strikes. Union members are not added to militia strength.

@prussian_police_training
view-if: spd_prussia == 1 and prussian_police_loyalty > 0.5
on-arrival: pps_militia_militancy += 0.05; sa_strength += 50; prussian_police_training += 1

Cooperative elements of the state police help train the militia, although other police formations may remain hostile.

@peace
on-arrival: pps_militia_militancy -= 0.02; pps_militia_strength -= 50; pacifism += 1

By avoiding every confrontation, the militia loses readiness and active members. Pacifists in the party gain influence.

@truce_rfb
choose-if: kpd_relation >= 45
view-if: kpd_truce == 0
unavailable-subtitle: The KPD is not interested.
on-arrival: kpd_truce = 1; kpd_relation += 5; rfb_strength += 50; pps_militia_strength += 50; sa_strength += 50;

We have made a temporary truce with the communist movement so that our respective militias stop fighting.
